      "Microsoft.VSTS.Common.AcceptanceCriteria": "<p>Given an international customer, when they reach checkout, then checkout is usable for them. </p><p>Given a non-EUR market, when prices are displayed, then they are correct for that market. </p><p>Given an international order, when it is placed, then it can be fulfilled like a domestic one. </p>",
