      "System.Description": "<p><b>Context:</b> Checkout is English-only, EUR-only, and offers cards and PayPal only, although the shop already ships to several EU markets. Checkout has not followed the international expansion. </p><p><b>Reason:</b> Sales wants five additional markets live this year; support reports non-English tickets already take days to resolve; finance has no position on display currencies and FX pricing. There is no single owner for international checkout. </p><p><b>Scope:</b> Not defined — markets, languages, currencies, and local payment methods are all open. </p>",
